sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Jobs as Job Engine
    participant Events as Event Store
    participant Gov as Resource Governor
    participant Adapter
    participant Ollama

    Client->>API: POST job with idempotency key
    API->>Jobs: create command
    Jobs->>Events: transaction job plus queued event
    Jobs-->>Client: 202 jobId
    Client->>API: GET job events after sequence
    API->>Events: replay and subscribe
    Jobs->>Gov: enqueue admission request
    Gov->>Ollama: reconcile running models
    Gov-->>Jobs: resource lease
    Jobs->>Adapter: execute immutable job snapshot
    Adapter->>Ollama: provider request
    loop Normalized stream
        Ollama-->>Adapter: provider chunk
        Adapter->>Events: append durable event
        Events-->>Client: SSE event
    end
    Adapter->>Jobs: final result
    Jobs->>Events: transaction terminal state and event
    Jobs->>Gov: release lease
    Events-->>Client: terminal event

